## 1️⃣ Add Node Role + Staging Flag

We need a way to designate a single staging node per vault.

```sql
-- =========================================
-- Extend semantic_tree_v2.tree_node
-- =========================================

ALTER TABLE semantic_tree_v2.tree_node
ADD COLUMN IF NOT EXISTS node_role TEXT
CHECK (node_role IN ('normal','staging'))
DEFAULT 'normal';

-- Only one staging node per vault
CREATE UNIQUE INDEX IF NOT EXISTS idx_one_staging_per_vault
ON semantic_tree_v2.tree_node(vault_id)
WHERE node_role = 'staging';
```

### Behavior

* Every vault must have exactly one staging node.
* Staging node behaves like:

  * A normal node structurally
  * Default drop location for unclassified docs
  * Eligible for scoped recluster

