Add to clustering service (simplified outline):

```python
def get_subtree_nodes(node_id, tree_index):
    # precomputed parent/children maps
    stack = [node_id]
    results = set()

    while stack:
        current = stack.pop()
        results.add(current)
        stack.extend(tree_index.children.get(current, []))

    return results
```

